{{feat
|type=class
|prereq=[[druid]] 16
|desc=The character with this ability can [[polymorph|take the shape of]] an elemental (a huge elemental at 16th [[class level|level]], and an elder elemental at 20th level). The ability may be used once per day at level 16, twice per day at level 17, and three times per day at level 19. At level 26 the druid is able to shift into elemental shape at will. The transformation has a duration of 1 [[hour]] per class level.
|use=selected. After choosing the ability, the character must choose one of four elemental types (earth, air, fire, or water) to become.
|icon=ife_eleshape.gif
|class1=druid
