== Notes ==

*This form of shapeshifting cannot be [[dispel]]led.
*Only armor (including shield and helmet) merges into elemental shape.
*All huge elemental shapes have [[damage reduction]] 10/+2, while the elder elemental shapes have 15/+3.
*All of these shapes have the usual [[elemental]] immunities to [[critical hit]]s, [[disease]], [[mind-affecting]] spells, [[paralysis]], [[poison]], and [[sneak attack]]s.
